WEBVTT

00:03.080 --> 00:05.800
Following the initial rise and glory of Great Xuan,

00:05.880 --> 00:06.880
Incompetent monarchs followed in succession,

00:07.000 --> 00:08.640
And factional strife tore the court apart.

00:08.720 --> 00:10.640
The northern Wunu seized the moment to invade south,

00:10.800 --> 00:12.320
Swiftly capturing Guanzhong.

00:13.240 --> 00:14.240
Before long,

00:14.320 --> 00:16.160
The imperial capital of Yong'an fell.

00:16.240 --> 00:18.200
The imperial clan was dragged off in chains,

00:18.360 --> 00:20.880
And the common people were ruthlessly slaughtered.

00:21.440 --> 00:23.360
Only the natural chasm of the Tianhe River

00:23.440 --> 00:26.400
Barely preserved half the fallen realm.

00:26.960 --> 00:28.320
Sikong Jing, the Prince of Langya,

00:28.400 --> 00:30.160
Was merely a distant branch of the royal line;

00:30.240 --> 00:31.640
Yet Chancellor Chen Dao,

00:31.920 --> 00:33.440
Joined by the great aristocratic clans,

00:33.560 --> 00:35.400
Enthroned him as the new Emperor.

00:35.480 --> 00:36.960
Here, south of the Tianhe River,

00:37.120 --> 00:38.880
He inherited the imperial mantle.

00:39.600 --> 00:40.880
You are Sikong Yao,

00:40.960 --> 00:43.040
The second son of His Imperial Majesty,

00:43.120 --> 00:45.120
Enfeoffed as the Prince of Jin.

00:45.360 --> 00:47.560
In this tumultuous, war-torn era,

00:47.840 --> 00:49.760
What path will you choose?

00:49.960 --> 00:52.280
How will the tides of history turn?

00:52.560 --> 00:53.520
Everything...

00:53.600 --> 00:55.880
Is yours to forge.

01:05.480 --> 01:06.680
What has happened?

01:06.760 --> 01:09.240
Must you go out so late into the night?

01:09.320 --> 01:10.120
Do not worry.

01:10.200 --> 01:11.680
Just a few poet friends

01:11.760 --> 01:13.120
Had a bit too much to drink and caused some commotion.

01:13.200 --> 01:14.867
I will go settle it.

01:32.160 --> 01:33.440
When a prince goes out on business,

01:33.520 --> 01:34.800
You cannot appear destitute.

01:34.880 --> 01:36.280
Take this with you.

01:39.800 --> 01:40.920
This piece of Kunshan jade

01:41.000 --> 01:41.720
Could easily cover our household's expenses

01:41.800 --> 01:43.200
For several months.

01:44.040 --> 01:45.480
Unless it is someone truly vital,

01:45.560 --> 01:47.520
Do not part with it lightly.

